# Sveltia CMS bundle, copied from node_modules by scripts/copy-cms.mjs.
# Listed path by path rather than as `public/admin/*`: everything else in that
# folder - index.html, config.yml - is this repository's own and must stay
# tracked, and a chunk that a CMS upgrade adds should show up in `git status`
# and be decided on, not disappear into a wildcard.
